#: action.py:3786
msgid ""
"Please put the Xteink X3 into\n"
"\"PC Transfer\" mode.\n"
"\n"
"If it was already active, turn it off and back on again first — a freshly "
"(re)activated mode responds far more reliably than one left on for a while.\n"
"\n"
"Once the mode is active, click OK."
